    "val": "OFDMA Decode Test \nThis test runs traffic to multiple STAs, checking for OFDMA operation. It first finds AIDs assigned to STAs, then matches AIDs to MAC addresses. \nSniffers (with associated AIDs) are then assigned to each STA.  Traffic is then simultaneously captured from all clients using the complete set of sniffers.",
